# Fused Workbench: isolated cause (PiG v0.7.0, go1.27.3, 2026-11-08T19:42:26+01:00)

## 1. Builder failure
piglet.yaml: extensions: [{name: pig-workbench, origins: [local:wbcopy/pig-workbench]}], build.extensionRealization: fused
pig piglet build piglet.yaml --format binary --out wb-pig --verbose
  note: fused member "pig-workbench" raises Pig's github.com/gofrs/flock v0.13.0 to v0.13.1
  [fused-wb] go: updates to go.mod needed; to update it: go mod tidy

## 2. Reproduction without the builder
PiG source cache copy; go.mod gets require+replace of github.com/furbyhaxx/pig-workbench; tiny main importing workbench.Extension.
GOFLAGS=-mod=readonly go build ./cmd/fusedprobe  -> go: updates to go.mod needed, disabled by -mod=readonly
go mod tidy, then the same build succeeds (35 MB binary).

